cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SmartAgri core: active, uncertainty-aware agronomic advisory"
abstract: >-
  Open core of an agronomic advisory system. It combines a deterministic decision model (input quality,
  applicability of knowledge passages, sufficiency, choice of the next question and a decision policy) with hybrid
  retrieval, FAO-56 tools and grounding checks, plus an evaluation harness with an ablation ladder, blind rating
  and a protocol lock.
type: software
